{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/b95fe77499e556d45dcbd35a845021aa.webp?t=1766562871\" width=614 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the fate of the ocean as you glide across an ever changing seascape in the hopes of reuniting Toroa with their family on land.  <br><br>Following the winds of the Atua (M\u0101ori God) of the weather, T\u0101whirim\u0101tea, Toroa will befriend creatures of the sea, meet distant relatives  while flying through dream-like clouds and lush oceanic environments grounded in the M\u0101ori world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/extras/9820f671895f48b877e65fd7994625ca.webp?t=1766562871\" width=614 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toroa have the largest wingspan in the world! Glide on wind currents and explore stylised landscapes, from calm seas to  verdant islands and into dream-like cloudscapes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures of the sea need your help. Chat with and befriend a colourful cast from the South Pacific including dolphins, whales, penguins and more!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade kelp with creatures and gather birds into a flock who will follow you all the way to the end of your journey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a knowledgeable seagull, identify a smorgasbord of tasty looking trash strewn about the ocean (NOT FOR CONSUMPTION)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a heartfelt story grounded in te ao M\u0101ori (the M\u0101ori world) centered on our precious ocean, family, past, present and future. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a lush soundtrack showcasing the beauty of taonga p\u016boro (M\u0101ori musical instruments) and experience the beauty of the M\u0101ori language  in character dialogue and story.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rere","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2003490/93b8f4cdbc5cef0b0f2f103c2c1369c34b08c8ca.jpg"},{"name":"M\u0101tauraka","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2003490/e3adbd0a2095a75d45dc5c0ebe367a04a715f160.jpg"},{"name":"Manaakitaka","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2003490/c017875ae79e11afde456cf657bd0490adfde426.jpg"},{"name":"Whanaukataka","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2003490/14d0ea1809e22df05b82f8710cdd36f944a5b0e0.jpg"},{"name":"Kaitiakitaka","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2003490/4ecc94ecd14992c1018265400b41d3b6ec48493c.jpg"},{"name":"Matakite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2003490/dbd1aa23c5e61058d312f6c9553e8b8622c6b3aa.jpg"},{"name":"Whakanoa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2003490/be535d6bf571f5394303f415336572bf97637026.jpg"},{"name":"M\u014dhiotaka","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2003490/ce7e99dd383cb7aa460db83355d9507cfd24d08d.jpg"},{"name":"Me he maoka \u0101wh\u0101","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2003490/3d3f42751e59675b19f95c81e374643e808bc943.jpg"},{"name":"Aroha","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2003490/46eeab85894ce0a3681ec33e818f94eafd92fcb5.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2003490?t=1766562871","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/4cb8b0ebc09805038857bd05d37eb86e18c