Pacific including dolphins, whales, penguins and more!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade kelp with creatures and gather birds into a flock who will follow you all the way to the end of your journey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a knowledgeable seagull, identify a smorgasbord of tasty looking trash strewn about the ocean (NOT FOR CONSUMPTION)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a heartfelt story grounded in te ao M\u0101ori (the M\u0101ori world) centered on our precious ocean, family, past, present and future. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a lush soundtrack showcasing the beauty of taonga p\u016boro (M\u0101ori musical instruments) and experience the beauty of the M\u0101ori language  in character dialogue and story.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Atawhai Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003490/3fd6c13e5079fb2628a81ba8d2b28b33bfd6605b/header.jpg?t=1766562871","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 All rights reserved. Atawhai Interactive, Toroa: Skycall, and their logos are registered trademarks of Atawhai Interactive Tapui Limited.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2003490/1776013568/827153669aa57e69820c8ff029ed9b624d7960e5/1765331308/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765332460","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2003490/1776013568/827153669aa57e69820c8ff029ed9b624d7960e5/1765331308/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765332460","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2003490/1776013568/827153669aa57e69820c8ff029ed9b624d7960e5/1765331308/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765332460","id":257246247,"name":"Toroa: Skycall Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/